                            	  4354: ; TODO: call it speed index or angle?
                            	  4355: ; Store the middle speed index in [00]. It will be changed to the
                            	  4356: ; right speed index to use incrementally.
                            	  4357: ; Lower speed indexes yield faster X speeds and lower Y speeds.
                            	  4358: ; Higher speed indexes yield faster Y speeds and lower X speeds.
