02:0003CA6A 0003CA7E        	  6995:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003CA6E 0003CA7E        	  6996:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated_Sub_Wait   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
