                            	 10871: ; Description:
                            	 10872: ; This block applies to heads and the bottom segment of a neck.
                            	 10873: ; These are drawn with sprites that come first in order, so that
                            	 10874: ; they are drawn above all other sprites, including Link.
                            	 10875: ;
                            	 10876: ; Params:
                            	 10877: ; A: tile number
                            	 10878: ;
